B.ahm=new A.a6(B.jT,["Dr. Steffen Pauls","Founder, Chairman and Co-CEO","assets/Backgrounds/cvcguy.jpg","Steffen founded Investment Cove in [Year] with the vision to democratize private investing... [Full bio text here] ... He worked as a research assistant at Harvard University where he wrote his master thesis. Steffen lives in [City] with his wife and children."],t.w)
