B.ahk=new A.a6(B.jT,["Magnus Grufman","Chief Operating Officer","assets/Backgrounds/cvcstaff.jpg","Magnus runs Private Equity for Investment Cove, ensuring that our investors have access to a steady flow of top-tier private equity funds... [Full bio text here] ... In his free time Magnus practices his passions of sports, cooking and photography."],t.w)
B.ahn=new A.a6(B.jT,["Marine Eug\xe8ne","Chief Commercial Officer","assets/Backgrounds/cvcstaff.jpg","Marine is responsible for setting the global direction of all Investment Cove' activities around marketing, direct sales and customer service... [Full bio text here] ... She has a Masters in International Business, Asian Affairs with English & Chinese Mandarin, from the International Affairs College at Le Havre University."],t.w)
